 "description": "\"Recent transactions of [wallet]\" / \"tx history for [0x...]\" / \"what has [address] done lately\" \u2014 recent transactions for an EVM address. Pass chain + 0x address; optionally filter by direction (to/from). Use for wallet-activity audit, fund-flow tracing.",
